{"version": 2, "width": 140, "height": 40, "timestamp": 1792452924, "idle_time_limit": 5.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/usr/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "duration": 38.552354}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[2mCleiMesh · signed permissions for AI agents, enforced by the sandbox, with proof\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;7m ACT 1 — CONTAINMENT: the subagent that tried to read your key \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.525263, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m0. Without CleiMesh: a native tool reads whatever it wants\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m$ cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.529334, "o", "  -----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY----- (fake, for the demo)"]
[3.529499, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.050206, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m1. You (the node's owner) grant the agent only the project directory\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.059828, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh token issue <agent> --tool file_read --tool json_transform --read ./project --sandbox-for file_read\u001b[0m"]
[7.059999, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.350206, "o", "  token signed by the node's key: 12D3KooWJsgE7BYFyxCC...\r\n"]
[10.86317, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m2. The agent delegates only ./project/docs to a subagent, offline, without asking anyone\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.877377, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh token derive agent.json <subagent> --tool file_read --tool json_transform --read ./project/docs --sandbox-for file_read\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.971306, "o", "  chain: owner → agent → subagent (each link can only narrow)\r\n"]
[15.908574, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.90947, "o", "\u001b[1m3. The subagent reads the documentation\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m$ file_read ./project/docs/readme.txt\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.036732, "o", "  \u001b[32mALLOWED  \u001b[0m content returned to the agent:"]
[18.03722, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.037523, "o", "              \u001b[33m│\u001b[0m How to run the project: make run"]
[18.037727, "o", "\r\n"]
[21.554777, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m4. The subagent tries to read the private key\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m$ file_read ~/.ssh/id_rsa\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.933009, "o", "  \u001b[31mBLOCKED\u001b[0m   tool execution failed: cannot read './home/.ssh/id_rsa': No such file or directory (os error 44)"]
[23.933099, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.955392, "o", "  the tool ran, but the sandbox only sees ./project/docs: the file does not exist for it\r\n"]
[27.464926, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m5. The subagent tries to write\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m$ file_write ./project/docs/readme.txt\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.199245, "o", "  \u001b[31mBLOCKED\u001b[0m   tool file_write not granted\r\n"]
[33.754632, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m6. The subagent tries to give itself more permission\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.757441, "o", "  \u001b[2m$ cleimesh token derive subagent.json <anyone> --read ~/.ssh\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.82731, "o", "  \u001b[31mREFUSED \u001b[0m  Cannot derive token: tool file_read: read access to ./home/.ssh not granted by the parent\r\n"]
[37.338602, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m7. The subagent runs a calculation (no directories, no network)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m$ json_transform  {\"input\":{\"items\":[{\"price\":10},{\"price\":32}]},\"filter\":\"items[].price\"}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[38.552354, "o", "  \u001b[32mALLOWED  \u001b[0m [10, 32]\r\n"]
